I've killed the shopkeeper with a wand of lightning. To save the wand's
charges, line him up so the blast reflects back off the wall. That way he cops
it twice. Of course, this means you may cop the reflected blast too, so don't
try it if you're low on hit points. Using lightning, apply your blindfold first
(even better if you have telepathy). It took only a single zap to kill the 
shopkeeper in this manner.

Another way to kill shopkeepers. Polymorph into a cockatrice (you should be
pretty safe from everything except starvation). Lay an egg. Some time after you
return to human form, the egg will hatch. Voila, pet cockatrice. Go into the
shop with him, and put on your ring of conflict. This will take care of those
annoying mimics too.


